@title Cabinet: plate triangles and Issues rows after the follow-up, no duplicate ids (1920x1080)
@area Cabinet
@sizes 1920x1080
# T1 follow-up regression: this project has no Place-rule or opening flag, so the rows must stay exactly as before and the plate must draw cleanly. The counted rule rows are covered by the unit test a_rule_flag_is_in_the_top_bar_count_and_the_issues_rows.
open qa/fixtures/cabinet-lesson.novo
wait 30
click_text Cabinet #1
wait 30
shot plate-badges
check_layout
expect_not "Second use of widget ID"
click_text "error" Button
wait 10
expect "F8 next"
shot issues-rows
check_layout
expect_not "Second use of widget ID"
